#doc (Page) "about" =>

I am an assistant professor in the
[Department of Computer Science and Information Engineering](https://csie.ntut.edu.tw/)
and [iFIRST](https://ifirst.ntut.edu.tw/index.php?Lang=en) at
[National Taipei University of Technology](https://www-en.ntut.edu.tw/).

Before joining NTUT, I was a postdoctoral researcher in
[Kai-Min Chung's lab](https://homepage.iis.sinica.edu.tw/~kmchung/) at
[Academia Sinica](https://www.iis.sinica.edu.tw/en/index.html).
Earlier, I was a postdoctoral researcher at the
[Institute of Mathematics](https://www.math.sinica.edu.tw/f59addca-1da6-47fd-9bb8-18d087da6088),
Academia Sinica.

I received my PhD from [IMJ-PRG](https://www.imj-prg.fr/en/) and
[Universite de Paris Diderot Paris VII](https://u-paris.fr/),
under the supervision of Marc Rosso and
[Olivier Schiffmann](https://sites.google.com/site/olivierschiffmann/).

My current research focuses on formal methods, verification, automata,
decision procedures and quantum computing, especially quantum program
and circuit verification.

At Taipei Tech (NTUT), I teach algorithms, compilers, computational
logic and software verification, and formal languages.

For publications, please see [DBLP](https://dblp.org/pid/338/7203.html).
